        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c81b545-a234-46c5-9296-54f9f2a0bb6d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Tonight&apos;s target is a big movie star named Dino Bosco. Bosco is currently filming his new movie at Sapienza, and has brought along his very expensive and sought-after Dino Bosco&apos;s own customized car. Our client wants you to steal &quot;Bosco&apos;s car keys&quot; from Bosco&apos;s own private booth and escape the mission in the car. The client has also asked you to assassinate Bosco while not being a problem in selling the car on the black market. Good hunting.",
